<title>UK: DG Bank sets 1.0 billion mark bond due June 2000.</title>
<headline>DG Bank sets 1.0 billion mark bond due June 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG BANK DEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    05.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.6475   PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    99.6475   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.1375    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
